{"schemaVersion":1,"id":43,"sections":[{"id":"116004-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[1440],"start":0,"count":12},{"id":"116004-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[11430],"start":12,"count":17},{"id":"116005-PROLOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战前","scripts":[1450],"start":29,"count":17},{"id":"116005-EPILOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战后","scripts":[11440],"start":46,"count":21},{"id":"116006-PROLOGUE","name":"第 3 战 · 战前","scripts":[1460],"start":67,"count":21},{"id":"116006-EPILOGUE","name":"第 3 战 · 战后","scripts":[11450],"start":88,"count":16}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116004-PROLOGUE:1440:0","scriptId":1440,"text":"由于看到埃普西隆朝自己冲了过来，我想都不想直接以最大力气踩下油门，一路往外飞驰。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":500,"speaker":"米佳·叶戈罗夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116004-PROLOGUE:1440:2","scriptId":1440,"text":"“长官把埃普西隆引开了，我们也迅速撤离吧！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":500,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":127,"speaker":"达利波娃·戈沃罗夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116004-PROLOGUE:1440:3","scriptId":1440,"text":"“干得不错嘛……竟然还能替我们引开那个怪物。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":500,"right":127,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":120,"speaker":"芙琳·勒布","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116004-PROLOGUE:1440:4","scriptId":1440,"text":"“不知道长官要不要紧……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":120,"right":127,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116004-PROLOGUE:1440:5","scriptId":1440,"text":"虽然自己这里摆脱了危险，但同样的危险转移到了指挥官那里，芙琳露出了不安的神色。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":120,"right":127,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":32,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116004-PROLOGUE:1440:6","scriptId":1440,"text":"“愣在那干什么！还不快从后面追，长官一个人肯定拖不久的！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":32,"right":127,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":116,"speaker":"芙琳·勒布","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116004-PROLOGUE:1440:7","scriptId":1440,"text":"“佐伊不要激动，先把眼前的战车兽清理掉，不然我们会受到前后夹击的！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":32,"right":116,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116004-PROLOGUE:1440:8","scriptId":1440,"text":"虽然芙琳对佐伊进行了提醒，但还是没有拦住佐伊，眼睁睁地看着佐伊向指挥官的方向追去。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":32,"right":116,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":133,"speaker":"达利波娃·戈沃罗夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116004-PROLOGUE:1440:9","scriptId":1440,"text":"“算啦……佐伊那么看中长官，就让佐伊过去帮忙吧，我们帮她殿后呗。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":133,"right":116,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":500,"speaker":"米佳·叶戈罗夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116004-PROLOGUE:1440:10","scriptId":1440,"text":"“恩，边打边撤，殿后的话，我们三个也足够了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":133,"right":500,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":120,"speaker":"芙琳·勒布","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116004-PROLOGUE:1440:11","scriptId":1440,"text":"“话是这么说，可是……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":120,"right":500,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116004-PROLOGUE:1440:12","scriptId":1440,"text":"芙琳欲言又止。确实，现在说担心的话已经来不及了，还是好好的守护住佐伊的后方吧，芙琳这么想到。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":120,"right":500,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116004-EPILOGUE:11430:1","scriptId":11430,"text":"时间回溯到两个小时之前，索菲亚教官方面----","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":120,"right":500,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116004-EPILOGUE:11430:2","scriptId":11430,"text":"接到通报以后，索菲亚教官发现事态的严重性，迅速准备出击。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":120,"right":500,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":220,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116004-EPILOGUE:11430:3","scriptId":11430,"text":"“准备速度不能再快点吗？不要磨磨蹭蹭了！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":220,"right":500,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116004-EPILOGUE:11430:4","scriptId":11430,"text":"索菲亚努力抑制住心中的不安，但还是从语气中泄出了焦急的气息。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":220,"right":500,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":168,"speaker":"卓娅·朱可娃","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116004-EPILOGUE:11430:5","scriptId":11430,"text":"“已经是最快速度了……把巡逻中的我们直接借了过来，真的没问题嘛……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":220,"right":168,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116004-EPILOGUE:11430:6","scriptId":11430,"text":"回话的是卓娅，因为情况紧急，索菲亚直接把巡逻中的半支边防小队“借”了过来。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":220,"right":168,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":523,"speaker":"嘉莉娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116004-EPILOGUE:11430:7","scriptId":11430,"text":"“战况瞬息万变，我们只能尽力而为，希望能赶上吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":220,"right":523,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116004-EPILOGUE:11430:8","scriptId":11430,"text":"嘉莉娜----和卓娅同属一个边防支队，虽然外表看上去很年轻，但也是经历了不少战役的老兵了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":220,"right":523,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":511,"speaker":"阿芙罗拉","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116004-EPILOGUE:11430:9","scriptId":11430,"text":"“索菲亚说这次有非常强大的敌人……我们一定要好好加油。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":511,"right":523,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116004-EPILOGUE:11430:10","scriptId":11430,"text":"阿芙罗拉----边防支队主力，温文尔雅的外表下隐藏着一颗坚强的内心，据说战斗力和教官不相上下。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":511,"right":523,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":220,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116004-EPILOGUE:11430:11","scriptId":11430,"text":"“呼……虽然说这些有点晚，但是还请各位抱着必死的决心面对战斗。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":511,"right":220,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":169,"speaker":"卓娅·朱可娃","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116004-EPILOGUE:11430:12","scriptId":11430,"text":"“哼哼，很久没有听到这种发言了，心中的战斗之魂燃烧了！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":169,"right":220,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":523,"speaker":"嘉莉娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116004-EPILOGUE:11430:13","scriptId":11430,"text":"“卓娅每次都那么热血，简直是热血笨蛋。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":169,"right":523,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":511,"speaker":"阿芙罗拉","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116004-EPILOGUE:11430:14","scriptId":11430,"text":"“好了好了，只要认真应战就行，卓娅的战斗风格就是如此啦。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":511,"right":523,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":523,"speaker":"嘉莉娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116004-EPILOGUE:11430:15","scriptId":11430,"text":"“哼～每次都替卓娅开脱，你们俩感情真是太好了……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":511,"right":523,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":169,"speaker":"卓娅·朱可娃","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116004-EPILOGUE:11430:16","scriptId":11430,"text":"“是嘉莉娜太认真了啦！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":169,"right":523,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116004-EPILOGUE:11430:17","scriptId":11430,"text":"教官带着临时拖来的边防支队，向着主人公一行的方向前进中。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":169,"right":523,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116005-PROLOGUE:1450:2","scriptId":1450,"text":"视线仍然集中在教官方面----","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":169,"right":523,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116005-PROLOGUE:1450:3","scriptId":1450,"text":"索菲亚的队伍已经驶离了伏龙芝，以最快速度往通报地点前进。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":169,"right":523,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116005-PROLOGUE:1450:4","scriptId":1450,"text":"“不过没有逮到你们的克罗诺娅队长真是可惜。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":211,"right":523,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116005-PROLOGUE:1450:5","scriptId":1450,"text":"索菲亚带着调侃的口气对卓娅她们说道。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":211,"right":523,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":163,"speaker":"卓娅·朱可娃","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116005-PROLOGUE:1450:6","scriptId":1450,"text":"“唉，要抓到她还真是不容易～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":211,"right":163,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116005-PROLOGUE:1450:7","scriptId":1450,"text":"卓娅带着嘲讽的语气说着。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":211,"right":163,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":523,"speaker":"嘉莉娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116005-PROLOGUE:1450:8","scriptId":1450,"text":"“确实，像她那样的免费苦力哪里去找。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":211,"right":523,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116005-PROLOGUE:1450:9","scriptId":1450,"text":"嘉莉娜和卓娅的意见这次完全相同。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":211,"right":523,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":511,"speaker":"阿芙罗拉","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116005-PROLOGUE:1450:10","scriptId":1450,"text":"“你们俩别这么说，我们小队风评那么好一大半都是因为我们队长的功劳。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":511,"right":523,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116005-PROLOGUE:1450:11","scriptId":1450,"text":"从阿芙罗拉的话语中明显听得出不满。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":511,"right":523,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116005-PROLOGUE:1450:12","scriptId":1450,"text":"“好啦，不聊你们那个乐于助人的队长了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":511,"right":211,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":216,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116005-PROLOGUE:1450:13","scriptId":1450,"text":"“就和前面跟你们说的一样，这次的战斗目标很可能就是之前我遇到过的不明生物。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":511,"right":216,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116005-PROLOGUE:1450:14","scriptId":1450,"text":"索菲亚教官在出发之前已经把敌人的大致实力和队员们讲解了一下。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":511,"right":216,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":169,"speaker":"卓娅·朱可娃","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116005-PROLOGUE:1450:15","scriptId":1450,"text":"“不过阿芙罗拉在的话应该没什么大问题吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":169,"right":216,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":511,"speaker":"阿芙罗拉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116005-PROLOGUE:1450:16","scriptId":1450,"text":"“不好说，教官一个人不能战胜的对手……第一次遇到呢。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":169,"right":511,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116005-PROLOGUE:1450:17","scriptId":1450,"text":"“确实，克罗诺娅和阿芙罗拉如果都在的话，应该就十拿九稳了，但是我们并没有逮到那个大忙人……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":211,"right":511,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116005-PROLOGUE:1450:18","scriptId":1450,"text":"对话中并没有太大的紧迫感，索菲亚她们以最快的速度向事发地逼近中……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":211,"right":511,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116005-EPILOGUE:11440:0","scriptId":11440,"text":"教官代领着小队以惊人的速度行进着。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":211,"right":511,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116005-EPILOGUE:11440:2","scriptId":11440,"text":"突然看到前面有火光出现，然后一阵爆破的声音随之而来。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":211,"right":511,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116005-EPILOGUE:11440:3","scriptId":11440,"text":"从爆炸的声响和烟雾来判断的话，有好几处地方在同时进行着战斗。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":211,"right":511,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116005-EPILOGUE:11440:4","scriptId":11440,"text":"“看来她们还是挺能干的嘛。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":211,"right":211,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116005-EPILOGUE:11440:5","scriptId":11440,"text":"索菲亚之前焦急的神情得以缓和。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":211,"right":211,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":169,"speaker":"卓娅·朱可娃","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116005-EPILOGUE:11440:6","scriptId":11440,"text":"“那我们就加入战斗吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":169,"right":211,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116005-EPILOGUE:11440:7","scriptId":11440,"text":"卓娅指了指前面的一处战场，眼里闪烁着光芒。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":169,"right":211,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116005-EPILOGUE:11440:8","scriptId":11440,"text":"索菲亚教官点了点头，示意可以出击，卓娅便一溜烟地往前突击了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":169,"right":211,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116005-EPILOGUE:11440:9","scriptId":11440,"text":"“去跟着她，嘉莉娜，这家伙的战斗比较乱来，有什么消息记得立刻通报。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":169,"right":211,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":523,"speaker":"嘉莉娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116005-EPILOGUE:11440:10","scriptId":11440,"text":"“唉……是是是，支援‘战斗狂魔’的任务我已经确实的收到了……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":523,"right":211,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116005-EPILOGUE:11440:11","scriptId":11440,"text":"嘉莉娜向教官摊了摊手，也随着卓娅一同前去了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":523,"right":211,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116005-EPILOGUE:11440:12","scriptId":11440,"text":"“接下来，阿芙罗拉，你和我就往另一边吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":523,"right":211,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":511,"speaker":"阿芙罗拉","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116005-EPILOGUE:11440:13","scriptId":11440,"text":"“诶？那不是应该由我去支援卓娅吗？这样的话两边战力可以平衡一些……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":511,"right":211,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116005-EPILOGUE:11440:14","scriptId":11440,"text":"阿芙罗拉的判断从正常情况下看来没有任何问题，经验更加老道的索菲亚应该是不会犯那么低级的错误才对。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":511,"right":211,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116005-EPILOGUE:11440:15","scriptId":11440,"text":"想到这里阿芙罗拉才把心中的疑问抛了出来。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":511,"right":211,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116005-EPILOGUE:11440:16","scriptId":11440,"text":"“话是如此，不过你自己看一下，那边的爆炸烟雾有明显的不同，而且依我的战场直觉可以断定埃普西隆肯定在那。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":511,"right":211,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116005-EPILOGUE:11440:17","scriptId":11440,"text":"索菲亚斩钉截铁的语气让阿芙罗拉的疑问得以解答。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":511,"right":211,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":511,"speaker":"阿芙罗拉","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116005-EPILOGUE:11440:18","scriptId":11440,"text":"“那么我们就出发吧……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":511,"right":211,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116005-EPILOGUE:11440:19","scriptId":11440,"text":"阿芙罗拉摆出了一副全力以赴的备战架势。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":511,"right":211,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116005-EPILOGUE:11440:20","scriptId":11440,"text":"“恩，不错，那么就出发吧，接下来我要告诉你埃普西隆的能力，我们边走边说。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":511,"right":211,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":511,"speaker":"阿芙罗拉","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116005-EPILOGUE:11440:21","scriptId":11440,"text":"“是！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":511,"right":211,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116006-PROLOGUE:1460:2","scriptId":1460,"text":"一发发炮火轰击在地平线上，炮火的目标很明确，那是一辆正在疾驰的军用吉普车。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":511,"right":211,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116006-PROLOGUE:1460:3","scriptId":1460,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":211,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116006-PROLOGUE:1460:6","scriptId":1460,"text":"我死死踩住油门，紧闭着嘴，不说多余的话，以防咬到舌头。就在这时……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":211,"section":4,"shake":true},{"kind":"dialogue","head":176,"speaker":"伊诺·赞佩里尼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116006-PROLOGUE:1460:7","scriptId":1460,"text":"“长官，再往前的话，要遇上战车兽群了！！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":176,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116006-PROLOGUE:1460:8","scriptId":1460,"text":"“！！？？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":176,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116006-PROLOGUE:1460:9","scriptId":1460,"text":"听到伊诺的提醒，不由得松了松脚上的力道……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":176,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116006-PROLOGUE:1460:10","scriptId":1460,"text":"我一手握着方向盘，另一只手拿起一旁的望远镜。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":176,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116006-PROLOGUE:1460:11","scriptId":1460,"text":"“从这数量上来看，不能轻易突破啊，我们这是被包围了？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":176,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":180,"speaker":"伊诺·赞佩里尼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116006-PROLOGUE:1460:12","scriptId":1460,"text":"“好像是这样……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":180,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116006-PROLOGUE:1460:13","scriptId":1460,"text":"就在这时，埃普西隆已经渐渐追了过来，不过离我们还是有一定的距离。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":180,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":48,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"116006-PROLOGUE:1460:14","scriptId":1460,"text":"“哈哈，逃不掉了吧～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":48,"right":180,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116006-PROLOGUE:1460:15","scriptId":1460,"text":"“伊诺，向着目标的脚边发射榴弹攻击。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":180,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":185,"speaker":"伊诺·赞佩里尼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116006-PROLOGUE:1460:16","scriptId":1460,"text":"“诶？哦……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":185,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116006-PROLOGUE:1460:17","scriptId":1460,"text":"伊诺一下子没反应过来，不过还是照着命令做了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":185,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116006-PROLOGUE:1460:20","scriptId":1460,"text":"榴弹在埃普西隆的脚边炸开，扬起大量的尘土。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":185,"section":4,"shake":true},{"kind":"dialogue","head":48,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"116006-PROLOGUE:1460:21","scriptId":1460,"text":"“唉唉～这么明显的攻击对我是起不到作用的啦。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":48,"right":185,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116006-PROLOGUE:1460:22","scriptId":1460,"text":"埃普西隆得意的笑着，炮口闪着光芒，看来是启动了防弹能力。灰尘散尽之时，她惊讶得发现眼前就只剩一辆吉普车……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":48,"right":185,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":50,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"116006-PROLOGUE:1460:23","scriptId":1460,"text":"“这种时候还耍小聪明，无用的挣扎……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":50,"right":185,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":50,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"116006-PROLOGUE:1460:24","scriptId":1460,"text":"“怎么办呢？这时候如果兰布达在的话就好了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":50,"right":185,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116006-PROLOGUE:1460:25","scriptId":1460,"text":"无奈之下，埃普西隆开始观察起地面的痕迹，接着她就看到了履带留下的痕迹。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":50,"right":185,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":48,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"116006-PROLOGUE:1460:26","scriptId":1460,"text":"“往哪边跑都一样啦～不过追踪猎物还是挺好玩的说，我就陪你们玩玩吧～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":48,"right":185,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116006-EPILOGUE:11450:0","scriptId":11450,"text":"埃普西隆沿着履带留下的痕迹开始追踪了起来。就在这时……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":48,"right":185,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116006-EPILOGUE:11450:2","scriptId":11450,"text":"“开始发动攻击，目标——埃普西隆。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":185,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116006-EPILOGUE:11450:3","scriptId":11450,"text":"我通过无线电向对面的伊诺下达了命令。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":185,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":176,"speaker":"伊诺·赞佩里尼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116006-EPILOGUE:11450:4","scriptId":11450,"text":"“是，长官。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":176,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116006-EPILOGUE:11450:5","scriptId":11450,"text":"伊诺突然发动了攻击，不过埃普西隆的反应很快，立即对着榴弹飞来的方向发动了防弹能力。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":176,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":48,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"116006-EPILOGUE:11450:6","scriptId":11450,"text":"“恩，不错嘛，想偷袭我～不过太嫩了，你的大致方位我早已掌握，怎么可能会中的埋伏～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":48,"right":176,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116006-EPILOGUE:11450:7","scriptId":11450,"text":"“那可不一定。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":176,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":49,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"116006-EPILOGUE:11450:10","scriptId":11450,"text":"“唉呀！！！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":49,"right":176,"section":5,"shake":true},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116006-EPILOGUE:11450:11","scriptId":11450,"text":"埃普西隆的背部被击中了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":49,"right":176,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":49,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"116006-EPILOGUE:11450:12","scriptId":11450,"text":"“这怎么可能！？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":49,"right":176,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116006-EPILOGUE:11450:13","scriptId":11450,"text":"埃普西隆回头一看，原来吉普车方向，之前自己追捕的人类向着她发射了一枚“铁拳”火箭弹。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":49,"right":176,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":176,"speaker":"伊诺·赞佩里尼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116006-EPILOGUE:11450:14","scriptId":11450,"text":"“太好了！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":49,"right":176,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116006-EPILOGUE:11450:15","scriptId":11450,"text":"伊诺发出的欢呼声，因为通过她和长官的协作确确实实给予了埃普西隆一记重击。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":49,"right":176,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116006-EPILOGUE:11450:16","scriptId":11450,"text":"原来之前发动榴弹攻击只是障眼法，为了制造出我们弃车而逃的假象。随后让伊诺往反方向留下了明显的移动痕迹。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":49,"right":176,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116006-EPILOGUE:11450:17","scriptId":11450,"text":"果不其然，埃普西隆轻易的就上钩了。追捕伊诺的时候，就无意识地把背部的空档暴露出来。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":49,"right":176,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116006-EPILOGUE:11450:18","scriptId":11450,"text":"“一切都在计划之中，作战很顺利。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":176,"section":5,"shake":false}],"summaries":["继续教官路线","被埃普西隆追击中……"]}
